# Tests for New Behavior

When adding features or fixing non-trivial bugs:

- Add or update unit tests in `tests/unit/`
- Add integration tests in `tests/integration/` when touching external services (Questrade, etc.)
- Follow existing patterns in `conftest.py` and fixture modules

Tests keep regressions from creeping back in.
